{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["And Pharaoh awoke — he immediately went back to sleep and dreamed, etc. Between a brief slumber and a second sleep it is normal for a dream to shift to another matter, and he still does not pay attention to understand that this is a dream, until his sleep is completed and he wakes fully, and then: וייקץ פרעה — at last, והנה חלום; but until now he did not know."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:48.434829968Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}